<title>INDIA: India's SAIL 96/97 net seen sharply down.</title>
<headline>India's SAIL 96/97 net seen sharply down.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Steel Authority of India Ltd (SAIL) is expected to record a sharp decline in net profit for 1996/97 (April-March), according to a report by the Steel Ministry released on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The ministry said net profit in 1996/97 (April-March) was estimated at 6.53 billion rupees, down from 13.19 billion in the previous fiscal year.</p>
<p>For 1997/98, net profit is projected at 7.40 billion rupees, the ministry said in its annual performance budget.</p>
</text>
